    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50573" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰόβακχ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Bacchus invoked with the cry of</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰώ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>APl.</u>
				4.289
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Max.
				496
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in pl., <i>worshippers of
				the God</i>, name of a guild at Athens, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1109.35
			</span></i>, al. <span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>hymn beginning with</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰὼ Βάκχε</span>, such as were ascribed
			to Archilochus, <i><span class="en">
				Heph.
				15.9
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
